OL,3,AResident Evil movie director says he
OL,4,Awas not prepared for fan backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the hottest horror directors on
OL,7,Fthe planet adapting the world's most
OL,8,Fpopular scary video game series?
OL,10,FOn paper Zach Cregger and Resident Evil
OL,11,Fare the perfect unholy alliance.
OL,13,FThe film-maker was widely praised for
OL,14,Fhis original, imaginative work on
OL,15,Fhorror hits Weapons and Barbarian and
OL,16,Fis a long-time fan of the video game
OL,17,Fseries.
